id=untrust-emudhra
name=Untrust eMudhra Compromised CAs
version=v1.0.0
versionCode=100
author=untrust-emudhra
description=Removes trust in compromised eMudhra intermediate CA chains (Oct 2026). Distrusts emSign ECC Root CA - G3, AAA Certificate Services cross-sign root, and related eMudhra G3 roots from the system / Conscrypt CA store. Works with Magisk and KernelSU. Ref: https://emudhra.we-have-a-problem.com/
